id: pm-context-ht20
title: Certify pm-context on PM CLI/SDK 2026.10.4 and consolidate pending dependency updates
description: "Pin @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4, pm-ops@2026.10.4 and pm-changelog@2026.10.4 (latest npm), consolidate Dependabot updates (#121 codeql-action SHAs, #124 pm-cli, #125 @types/node, #126 pm-changelog, #127 pm-ops), fix the open brace-expansion security alert, re-copy the canonical merge-driver launcher from pm-ops 2026.10.4, and prove the full release gate green."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[2]: cert,deps
created_at: "2026-10-04T10:41:17.939Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-04T11:19:12.370Z"
assignee: codex-sol
claim_principal: codex-sol
author: pi-cert-a
actual_result: "Updated candidate: exact PM CLI, pm-ops and pm-changelog 2026.10.4; all devDependencies exact and Node types 26.6.4; Dependabot #121/#124/#125/#126/#127 consolidated, brace-expansion alert #5 patched to 5.0.12. Canonical launcher plus three broken-install/lookup regression fixtures; linked suite 9/9. Locked direct release:check PASS 286/286 with zero skips; V8 lines/branches/functions 100% across 5 sources (statements not independently measured). CI changelog check, strict pinned health and both audits PASS. Packed real-tracker npm/native Bun compact/JSON/output-file context packs PASS; scratch removed. Managed pm-github 2026.10.4 preview planned=0/synced=0. PM-linked full gate wrapper exit 5/command exit 1: init_existing_settings_requires_force in injected schema tracker, matching upstream pm-cli#1391. Final-head CI/reviews pending."
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-04T10:43:28.046Z",pi-cert-a,"Gate evidence: npm run release:check green 283/283 (typecheck, release-workflow, build, docstring, coverage, audit:prod, pack:dry-run, changelog:check with pm-changelog 2026.10.4, publish-attestation, changelog-date ok); ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit exits 0; npm audit and npm audit --omit=dev both 0 vulnerabilities. Dependabot security alert #5 (brace-expansion GHSA-q2hr-2g5m-vwhr, dev/transitive) resolved via npm audit fix -> brace-expansion 5.0.12. Launcher re-copied byte-identical from pm-ops@2026.10.4 templates.\n\nDogfood (pm-context-2026.10.3.tgz installed into a scratch copy of this repo's real tracker):\n- npm: 'npx -y @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 context-pack --status in_progress --format compact --limit 3' -> focus 3 with neighbors/links/recent sections; 'context-pack --tag cert --format json' -> structured JSON including this item.\n- bun: 'bunx --bun @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 context-pack --id pm-context-ht20 --neighborhood-depth 1 --format compact' -> agent handoff pack; 'context-pack --status open --limit 2 --output pack.md' -> wrote file (selected: 2).\nScratch copy deleted afterwards.\n\npm-github: installed as managed extension pm-github@2026.10.4; read-only preview 'pm github sync --repo unbraind/pm-context --dry-run' -> 'No pm items linked to unbraind/pm-context' planned 0. No issues created/modified, no scheduled sync."
  "2026-10-04T10:52:57.826Z",codex-sol,"Restart verification: retained changes and existing evidence inspected; exact-pin all devDependencies, use published pm-changelog 2026.10.4, then rerun the full CI gate, pinned health, audits and packed real-tracker npm/Bun acceptance. Preserve prior comments and avoid duplicate Dependabot superseded comments."
  "2026-10-04T10:55:54.842Z",codex-sol,Add the same real broken-install and ENOTDIR behavior regressions validated for pm-brief. Both repos carried identical launcher suites; byte identity alone cannot catch a shared template regression. Do not alter the canonical launcher or compatibility floor.
  "2026-10-04T11:19:12.369Z",codex-sol,"Restart validation completed: flock /tmp/claude-1000/heavy-gate.lock npm run release:check exits 0, 286/286 tests, zero skipped; configured V8 lines/branches/functions 100% over 5 sources, docstrings 8 files/27 declarations. CI additional npm run changelog:check passes, npx pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers passes, npm audit and npm audit --omit=dev zero vulnerabilities. Linked launcher run passes 9/9. Linked full release run fails only under the test harness: wrapper exit 5/command exit 1 and init_existing_settings_requires_force names /tmp/pm-linked-test-*/schema/project/.agents/pm for suite-created throwaway trackers. This is the same sandbox-redirect class as previously reproduced upstream pm-cli#1391; direct CI command passes without any gate edits. Packed receipt: npm pack --silent, install tarball with @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 into pm-context-dogfood, package install <tarball> --project copy.complete=true. Both npx -y @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 and bunx --bun -y @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 run context-pack --id pm-context-ht20 --neighborhood-depth 1 --format compact, context-pack --tag cert --format json, and context-pack --status open --limit 2 --output <runtime>-pack.md. Both runtimes render the real item and structured JSON; output files contain selected:2. Scratch copy removed. Managed pm-github 2026.10.4 dry-run sync planned=0/synced=0. The older leftover dogfood pack was archived before its scratch copy was removed."
